silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_05_validation_and_shapes_sections_02_shacl_as_implementation_concrete_anchor_2 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 02_shacl_as_implementation #2', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section '\\Acr{SHACL' the bare symbol ShaclConformant anchors to MittensBodyMassLocalInfo: The interpreted claim extracted from the vet record: 'Mittens has a body mass of 4.2 kg recorded by Dr. Osei on 2024-03-15.' This is the paraphrase stripped of formatting artifacts; it states the Forge-relevant fact.." .
